Date: Fri, 04 Apr 2025 10:26:46 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] [JSW-31] module: added jgs files in soc init

Currently added same files as FS1 for JGS for
asic build.

Change-Id: I37b0053464b7cb1713a3d56ee3bf702752e5a1fa
